ks, far more common than in production; precision on real data would be lower at the same threshold.", "Labels are exact by construction. Real labels (filed STRs, confirmed fraud) are delayed, incomplete and noisy.", "The neighbourhood features are fixed 2-hop averages, not a trained graph neural network; a learned GNN is the next step once real labelled data is available.", "The analyst-workload figures assume 20 minutes of review per alert. That is an assumption, not a measurement from a pilot."], "runtime_seconds": 359.1}, "benchmark": {"generated_at": "2026-10-07T03:41:18Z", "machine": "a 8-core laptop (x86_64, Python 3.11.2), single process, inside Docker", "scoring_path": [{"transactions": 12165, "accounts": 1098, "feature_seconds": 0.11873958099977244, "scoring_seconds": 0.01586128999997527, "total_seconds": 0.1346008709997477, "transactions_per_second": 90378.31560557139, "peak_memory_mb": 184.36328125}, {"transactions": 45803, "accounts": 4383, "feature_seconds": 0.38325768400000015, "scoring_seconds": 0.026969653999913135, "total_seconds": 0.4102273379999133, "transactions_per_second": 111652.72461683108, "peak_memory_mb": 236.12109375}, {"transactions": 138866, "accounts": 13151, "feature_seconds": 1.5006253059996197, "scoring_seconds": 0.09154346400009672, "total_seconds": 1.5921687699997165, "transactions_per_second": 87218.14082562663, "peak_memory_mb": 372.37890625}, {"transactions": 461079, "accounts": 43843, "feature_seconds": 6.165425255000173, "scoring_seconds": 0.41449566300025253, "total_seconds": 6.5799209180004254, "transactions_per_second": 70073.63853547916, "peak_memory_mb": 842.3671875}, {"transactions": 1039635, "accounts": 98656, "feature_seconds": 16.641053227000157, "scoring_seconds": 0.6182127470001433, "total_seconds": 17.2592659740003, "transactions_per_second": 60236.3392259049, "peak_memory_mb": 1675.0703125}], "full_pipeline": [{"transactions": 12165, "accounts": 1098, "total_seconds": 1.769720043000234, "transactions_per_second": 6873.968596398155, "detection_mode": "exhaustive graph search"}, {"transactions": 45803, "accounts": 4383, "total_seconds": 4.603884602000107, "transactions_per_second": 9948.772386714772, "detection_mode": "temporal flow tracing"}, {"transactions": 138866, "accounts": 13151, "total_seconds": 15.792707471000085, "transactions_per_second": 8793.045793762569, "detection_mode": "temporal flow tracing"}], "micro_batch": {"transactions": 9345, "accounts": 8207, "total_seconds": 0.21189261500012435}, "api_latency": null, "note": "Single process, in memory, no GPU. The scoring path is what a production deployment would run per micro-batch; the full pipeline also builds a NetworkX graph and writes evidence text for every account. A streaming bus (Kafka) and a graph database (Neo4j) are the planned next step and are not part of this measurement."}}